Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Insights Client Registration Fails
Symptoms: Registration command fails with authentication errors

Solution:

# Check subscription status
sudo subscription-manager status

# Re-register if needed
sudo subscription-manager register --username=your_username --password=your_password

# Then register with Insights
sudo insights-client --register
Issue 2: Automated Updates Not Working
Symptoms: DNF automatic timer is not applying updates

Solution:

# Check timer status
sudo systemctl status dnf-automatic.timer

# Check configuration
sudo cat /etc/dnf/automatic.conf

# Manually test update process
sudo dnf --security check-update
sudo dnf -y --security update
Issue 3: Remediation Script Permissions
Symptoms: Script fails to execute with permission errors

Solution:

# Fix script permissions
sudo chmod +x /opt/insights-remediation/*.sh

# Check SELinux context if needed
sudo restorecon -R /opt/insights-remediation/

# Verify script ownership
sudo chown root:root /opt/insights-remediation/*.sh
